    given-names: "Kinzang R."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-18
repository-code: "https://github.com/kinzangrlhendup/non-contact-ignition-coil-detector-hobby-project"
url: "https://github.com/kinzangrlhendup/non-contact-ignition-coil-detector-hobby-project"
abstract: >-
  An educational non-contact automotive ignition-coil firing detector developed
  using LTspice and KiCad. The project includes a PCB meander pickup, envelope
  detector, adjustable LM393 comparator, alarm driver, simulation results and
  a through-hole PCB design.
keywords:
  - automotive diagnostics
  - ignition coil
  - non-contact sensing
  - LTspice
  - KiCad
  - PCB design

